<TITLE>Fluid Temperature Sensor</TITLE>
<LIST1><ITEM><PTXT>To ensure shift characteristics in the extremely low temperature range and for flex lock-up control, a fluid temperature sensor has been installed in the valve body. It directly detects the ATF temperature in the transaxle hydraulic control circuit.</PTXT></ITEM></LIST1>
